    "segments": [
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 6,
        "sourceEnd": 103,
        "text": "So, this is the room where the old card catalogue used to stand. Now it's our 'Listening Corner'.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "87b029ccf34c206cbba991902068bb90cdf533ad7afbc7d50ff568764dfe3689",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0
      },
      {
        "role": "owen",
        "speaker": "Owen",
        "sourceStart": 111,
        "sourceEnd": 224,
        "text": "It looks completely different. I remember when this place was just shelves and silence. Who decided to change it?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "8822d71da3357f16a4a13baa099918416a0c958ffddf5269c3672f1f6708bd32",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.7
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 232,
        "sourceEnd": 395,
        "text": "The board did, about two years ago. They realised that people weren't coming in to borrow books as much as they used to. The numbers had been falling for a decade.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "dfadff86d4781856ecc21e92a7b70cb3d6d07c492e4ab7f4197be7e5e9c90835",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.7
      },
      {
        "role": "owen",
        "speaker": "Owen",
        "sourceStart": 403,
        "sourceEnd": 434,
        "text": "So the change wasn't your idea?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "340c6b73caf52471534edbc38e26d70810365597993631bcb10dfa70d06310dd",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.7
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 442,
        "sourceEnd": 640,
        "text": "No, but I supported it. The board asked me to run a small project. We interviewed forty local residents. The main thing they told us was that they wanted a place to meet, not just a place to borrow.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "3bb71b3f98a2091912008e8110c51dd6eec05f413b0cf9e4a470362e23d17466",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.7
      },
      {
        "role": "owen",
        "speaker": "Owen",
        "sourceStart": 648,
        "sourceEnd": 662,
        "text": "And the books?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "a6485e55899c055921c3dbe545b77e51b669b08c7212730e178a26256d414222",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.7
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 670,
        "sourceEnd": 853,
        "text": "We kept most of them. Only about ten per cent were removed, mostly old reference books that nobody had touched in years. The rest are still here, but they're arranged differently now.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "cdec46379c7186a284291287e7a9cde61fc3f3bf8921c07c2c05a6922b20058c",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.7
      },
      {
        "role": "owen",
        "speaker": "Owen",
        "sourceStart": 861,
        "sourceEnd": 900,
        "text": "I see. And what happens in this corner?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "7aa7df66e1b9a6a96d00c32f888d12da40af9dc7d423f0a1b929213d3e951578",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.7
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 908,
        "sourceEnd": 1108,
        "text": "On Tuesdays we have a reading group for adults. On Thursdays, a story hour for children. The children's sessions are the most popular — we often have to turn people away because the room is too small.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "b239da8ade003b4c28bcd930a0c65d00b6b517d4878e42a1148173e81abbeeb8",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.7
      },
      {
        "role": "owen",
        "speaker": "Owen",
        "sourceStart": 1116,
        "sourceEnd": 1177,
        "text": "That sounds like a problem. Could you move to a bigger space?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "90c12a58d3893dd388cefe1f3fbc4cab25d2cec4ba8503d5e00ad46a75902a13",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.7
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 1185,
        "sourceEnd": 1288,
        "text": "We could, but the rent would be much higher. The board is considering it. They might decide next month.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "3e2b6eee428889c7f5f3159165abac38823c36f49b2da85c6c3521fea5f95aeb",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.7
      },
      {
        "role": "owen",
        "speaker": "Owen",
        "sourceStart": 1296,
        "sourceEnd": 1338,
        "text": "What about the people who just want quiet?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "3fca2baec43117d81c42f441fa3026b75d1465121e2cdeea2e288d08bbf940cb",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.7
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 1346,
        "sourceEnd": 1471,
        "text": "That's a fair point. We've kept the back room as a silent study area. It's the only part of the building that hasn't changed.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "d1515bdf4c68792e77e7d3dac1668cf72036514d9dcd9ddcce6391742e5ef077",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.7
      },
      {
        "role": "owen",
        "speaker": "Owen",
        "sourceStart": 1479,
        "sourceEnd": 1505,
        "text": "And has borrowing gone up?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "3a2fd97befc558e4a8acb1f51f04b8f3db2e945f097a34f63714c78fb047b221",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.7
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 1513,
        "sourceEnd": 1662,
        "text": "Actually, yes. Not dramatically, but it's stopped falling. Last year we lent about eight thousand items, which is slightly more than the year before.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "343b9da154453af9a889fac7b1ce0761dfd05af0a2b1a1c3a33825d2658822e7",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.7
      },
      {
        "role": "owen",
        "speaker": "Owen",
        "sourceStart": 1670,
        "sourceEnd": 1695,
        "text": "So the change is working?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "babdfae721df7be28f269e5ae50ff6cbae39503f41d37a1ebabf396e900643c9",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.7
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 1703,
        "sourceEnd": 1835,
        "text": "Partly. The board says the library is busier, but they're still worried about money. The project costs more than the old system did.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "2a1b93f323c64009ace04fefcad8de701cbbff07d8851557bbcb80c1126d9079",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.7
      },
      {
        "role": "owen",
        "speaker": "Owen",
        "sourceStart": 1843,
        "sourceEnd": 1872,
        "text": "Do you think it will survive?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "df5719fafa67376ad0f3e8412e3aec8b7aae52e6517b1d44564da9e05e2a55db",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.7
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 1880,
        "sourceEnd": 2020,
        "text": "I hope so. The people who use it now are very loyal. But nothing is certain. If the funding stops, we'll have to close the Listening Corner.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "92447a7eb31f4b1e7bfff1e8813515a1fe04ae6d11ca2e2f8547f87857968858",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.7
      },
      {
        "role": "owen",
        "speaker": "Owen",
        "sourceStart": 2028,
        "sourceEnd": 2050,
        "text": "That would be a shame.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "29095cf7ef7a9ca567c88111d123b8c58621bbcaa3d2cbc67b293ae376c6c59d",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.7
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 2058,
        "sourceEnd": 2137,
        "text": "It would. But at least we tried something new. That's more than most places do.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "8f055bf14660f7b63d5b909e72741b140781beb153cf1f2f7284aa90c7a01326",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.7
      }
    ]
  },
